unctionality, which would require code and architecture changes during migr=
ation.</p><p><br></p><p><code><strong>SQL Server 2016 on Azure virtual mach=
ines</strong></code> is <strong>incorrect</strong> because while it support=
s all required features and minimizes code changes, it introduces higher ma=
nagement overhead (e.g., manual patching, backups, and maintenance), which =
conflicts with the requirement to minimize administrative effort.</p><p><br=
